WEBVTT

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:08.190
Ow...

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.380
<i>You have a hangover.</i>

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.860
Yeah, yeah, I know.

00:00:14.090 --> 00:00:17.580
Th-This time, I'm really 
never going to drink again.

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.770
Hey, it's the girl who 
walked across the river.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:23.870
Look, it's the girl who crossed the river.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.630
It's the lady from the river? Hi, lady!

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.880
Well, well, if it isn't the famed Lady Cayna,
 who parted the great river.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:37.640
E-Even you heard about that...

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:40.140
I'm sorry. I'm just kidding.

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.970
So, what's the matter?

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:45.930
If you want to become a mercenary 
and join us Flame Spears,

00:00:45.930 --> 00:00:47.390
we'll welcome you with open arms.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:51.340
Our caravan will be happy 
to welcome you in, as well.

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.670
Though, I must say...

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:55.170
That doesn't seem to be the case.

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:00.120
Ah, well... You know of 
the Silver Tower, right?

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:05.040
Have you seen towers like 
that anywhere before?

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.840
Let's see...

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:11.550
I have heard that there's a beautiful 
castle in the middle of a lake

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:14.700
in the Kingdom of Helshper up 
north that no one can enter.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.110
A kingdom up north...

00:01:16.460 --> 00:01:19.140
<i>I think there was a huge war there before.</i>

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:23.220
Is the goal of your journey 
to find this place?

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:27.000
Well... I don't have much else to do.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.020
If you find anything else out,
 please let me know.

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:32.730
Sure, leave it to us.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.360
But of course.

00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:37.780
Ah, if it isn't Miss Cayna, 
who swallowed up the great river!

00:01:38.110 --> 00:01:40.030
Can we just stop with that?

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:43.490
You have a summons from the Royal Academy.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:45.060
A summons?

00:01:45.060 --> 00:01:47.700
<i>I wonder what that's all about. Well, whatever.</i>

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:49.990
<i>I might actually be able to see Mai-Mai.</i>

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:24.970
<b>A Daughter, a Colosseum, Losing Control, and an Uppercut</b>

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:24.970
<b>A Daughter, a Colosseum, Losing Control, and an Uppercut</b>

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:27.970
You did mention that you 
were a student here, didn't you?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:33.400
Y-Yes, and I help out the headmaster.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:39.030
Oh, and thank you for yesterday. 
The Knight Corps were quite surprised

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.320
because you captured him so quickly.

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:43.950
Primo's such a handful.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.460
Do you just want me to catch him

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.990
without permission if I see 
him wandering around again?

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:51.350
Please do. And, um...

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:54.420
Wh-What did you do to get a summons?

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.400
I'd like to know that myself.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.370
This is the headmaster's office.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:03.590
<i>Mai-Mai's just beyond this door.</i>

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:04.930
Come in.

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:06.510
P-Please excuse us.

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.070
<i>So that's...</i>

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:13.810
H-Headmaster.

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:16.810
I've brought... her?

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:21.620
Oh, it's been too long, Mother!

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.170
What?!

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:25.470
There, there, Mai-Mai.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:26.490
What?!

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:29.910
<i>She's so tall now. Oh, right.</i>

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:36.120
Ow! That hurt, Mother.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:39.000
You're the headmaster, 
remember? What are you doing?

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:42.170
But we haven't seen each other in 200 years.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.400
Lonti, are you okay?

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:52.020
U-U-U-U-Um! You're the headmaster's mother?!

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:53.950
Yes, I am.

00:04:53.950 --> 00:04:56.370
Yay, Mother!

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:03.650
Thank you, Miss Arbalest. You may go now.

00:05:03.650 --> 00:05:07.820
U-Um, okay. P-Please excuse me.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:16.190
Say, Mai-Mai.

00:05:16.190 --> 00:05:18.170
Y-Yes, Mother?

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:23.340
Why did you summon me here? 
So you could glomp me?

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:26.930
No. Th-There is something 
I need to discuss with you.

00:05:27.940 --> 00:05:30.470
I'm not saying you can't 
ask to be babied at all,

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.960
but you're in a respected 
position as headmaster, aren't you?

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.810
Yes...

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:38.610
So what did you want to talk about?

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:48.740
Come on, I wasn't expecting a 
little missy like her to show up.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:53.710
Why is it everyone keeps calling 
me "missy" wherever I go?

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.730
Come on, Lopus. Don't talk to her like that.

00:05:56.730 --> 00:05:58.670
She's my mother.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:00.790
What?

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:05.660
This is the professor of alchemy here 
at the Royal Academy, Lopus Harvey.

00:06:05.660 --> 00:06:07.470
He's my husband.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:08.500
Wha?

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.740
She's your mother?

00:06:09.740 --> 00:06:10.640
Husband?

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.430
Oh, no! I finally said it! 
I just blurted it out!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:20.630
I'm sorry. I clearly should've 
taken better care of her.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:21.980
She must be a handful.

00:06:22.310 --> 00:06:27.980
Nah. Her airheadedness has actually helped 
me out at times, so I can't complain.

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.940
You seem like a nice guy.

00:06:31.940 --> 00:06:35.240
Please continue to take care of her, Lopus.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.350
My name is Cayna.

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:41.540
Missy... I mean, Lady Cayna, it's a 
pleasure to make your acquaintance.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:45.720
Hey! Why are you passionately 
shaking hands without me?!

00:06:48.910 --> 00:06:53.950
Why are you staring me down like that?

00:06:54.950 --> 00:06:58.250
So this is what we wanted 
to talk to you about.

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.480
Wait, isn't that my...

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:02.200
I knew it.

00:07:02.200 --> 00:07:06.370
I gave my students an assignment to create 
a potion, and one of them brought me this.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:09.150
Ah, so that's what that quest was for.

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:15.120
This is basically an artifact-class potion 
that no one knows how to make anymore.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:19.970
I see. So they're not even 
made the same way anymore.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.030
If too many people know about this,

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:24.920
it'll turn our established basics 
of preparation on their head.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:27.500
Please be careful not to 
let too many people know.

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:29.820
Sure thing. Got it.

00:07:29.820 --> 00:07:31.090
Now then, Lady Cayna,

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.340
I have a request for you.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.340
Boo, boo... Boo, boo...

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:41.970
This mage is Lady Cayna. 
She's the headmaster's mother.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:44.100
What?!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.100
Pipe down!

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:50.910
Lady Cayna is going to demonstrate 
how to make a high potion.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:52.150
Watch carefully.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:53.410
Yes, sir!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:58.700
<i>Didn't he just say to not 
let too many people know?</i>

00:07:58.990 --> 00:08:01.620
<i>That was then. This is now.</i>

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.790
Okay, let's get started.

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:08.090
<b>Item Box</b>

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:12.480
Okay, so, you take these 
ingredients and use this thing,

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:15.300
and go like this and this, and this...

00:08:15.300 --> 00:08:18.260
And there you go, a high potion.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.770
Splendid work, Mother!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.760
Okay, well, bye.

00:08:25.550 --> 00:08:27.270
I have a question.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.690
And me answering will depend on the question.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:32.030
Where did the vial come from?

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:34.610
<i>How the hell would I know?</i>

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.240
<i>Ask Leadale's admins.</i>

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.330
Mother, are you leaving already?

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:42.400
I'll come by again.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:43.470
Okay...

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:56.580
"Please take care of a ghost for us. 
From colosseum staff. Reward: 8 silvers."

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:00.500
Why, yes.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.390
There's been some panic because 
 a ghost has apparently been

00:09:03.390 --> 00:09:04.980
showing up at the colosseum.

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:10.330
Are you sure about this, though? 
Many adventurers have failed this quest.

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:12.780
Is ghostbusting that hard?

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:16.430
They go in all confident, 
proclaiming that ghosts don't exist,

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:19.650
then come running back after 
seeing that they actually do.

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:20.770
Huh...

00:09:20.770 --> 00:09:24.250
<i>But I mean... ghosts actually don't exist.</i>

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:27.800
<i>I wonder what it could be. Maybe it's 
some undead monster or something.</i>

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.430
<i>Then it's probably manageable... I think.</i>

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:33.260
What would you like to do, Cayna?

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:35.130
I'll go ahead and take it.

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:36.690
Okay, accepted.

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.950
Hello?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:02.780
Yes, I absolutely love my mother!

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:06.260
Mother Dearest! M-Mother Dearest!

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.960
Mother Dearest!

00:10:12.040 --> 00:10:14.710
Um, are you really sure about this?

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:17.640
The other day, we had a group 
of five adventurers come by,

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:20.050
and they immediately ran away.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:24.720
Well, I'll spend two or three nights 
here to find out what's going on.

00:10:24.720 --> 00:10:27.550
Thank you very much. 
Please take care of this!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.930
Kee, apparently this colosseum's been here

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:41.700
since before the royal capital of 
Felskeilo was even established.

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.850
<i>So it's a historical site.</i>

00:10:43.850 --> 00:10:47.310
And no one has any idea who built this thing.

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:50.960
<i>I'm surprised they used such a shady
 venue for their entertainment.</i>

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:54.630
Yeah, that alone is giving me the creeps.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:08.600
Well, I guess I'll get ready, then.

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.880
<i>Eternal Flame. A rare weapon.</i>

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:19.860
Yup. It has a salamander inside.

00:11:20.250 --> 00:11:23.300
I'm pretty sure this'll take out 
any enemy with one blow.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.280
And...

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:26.860
Summoning Magic: Cerberus!

00:11:34.780 --> 00:11:37.170
I'll need you to patrol the area, Cerberwoof.

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:45.100
That should do it. I guess I'll get 
something to eat before it gets too dark.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:48.590
I think it's about ready.

00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:51.890
It smells so good!

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:54.580
S-Stop that! Let go of me! Hey!

00:11:54.580 --> 00:11:57.740
Hey, you! What the heck is this thing?

00:11:57.740 --> 00:11:59.310
It's a summoning spell.

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:02.990
I used it to summon an 
ordinary little cerberus.

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:05.320
I've never heard of magic like that.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:08.660
I guess you don't know much, then.

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:10.890
You can let him go now.

00:12:11.860 --> 00:12:15.960
Ow! Damn it, that's cold.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.460
Want some?

00:12:17.460 --> 00:12:19.050
Like I'd ev—

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:22.380
...ever say no to that!

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:27.940
Hot! Yum. Hot!

00:12:28.920 --> 00:12:29.640
This is good.

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:33.960
<i>He's so crude. Is he really royalty?</i>

00:12:34.410 --> 00:12:38.060
So, why'd you follow me all 
the way here from the city?

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:42.490
I wanted to find out who you really are.

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:46.160
You walked on water, caught me easily...

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:47.990
Then you said you were the mother of

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:51.900
Master Craftsman Kartatz and Headmaster 
Mai-Mai of the Royal Academy, too!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:55.330
And you used some weird spell... 
B-But most of all...

00:12:55.690 --> 00:13:01.460
When I saw Lonti earlier, 
she said she looked up to you, so...

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.680
<i>Aha, so that's it.</i>

00:13:06.650 --> 00:13:10.510
A-Anyway! I'm gonna find 
out who you really are!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:14.650
Honestly, I'm not that interesting.

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:17.140
Want some more?

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:17.940
Yes!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:26.740
Thanks for babysitting the kid, Cerberwoof.

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:30.160
Anything unusual? Guess not.

00:13:31.740 --> 00:13:34.420
He looks so comfy.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:39.050
I was told I could capture 
him without permission,

00:13:39.050 --> 00:13:42.040
but it's not like I can 
leave this place right now.

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:47.340
Actually, I hope no one thinks 
that I kidnapped this kid.

00:13:48.520 --> 00:13:49.640
But you know...

00:13:49.880 --> 00:13:52.260
I looked through every inch of this place,

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:55.060
but couldn't find any sign 
of anything hiding anywhere.

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:57.500
I wonder what's going on.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:05.070
Blanket time.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:18.500
I think I had another one...

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.000
Wow, it really showed up.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:32.720
If Cerberwoof isn't reacting, 
I guess it's not an evil spirit.

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:38.270
The Guardian Ring...

00:14:39.110 --> 00:14:41.210
Wait, no way!

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:45.940
This is the place?

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:48.730
Cerberwoof, look after Primo.

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:54.550
One who protects in times of trouble!

00:14:54.550 --> 00:14:58.070
I beseech you to rescue this 
depraved world from chaos!

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.350
I'll give you some MP.

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:49.660
Welcome, honored guest.

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:54.180
<i>What a chivalrous guardian.</i>

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:57.160
Guess you've finally 
gone senile, you old hag.

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:00.480
<i>Nothing like the good ol' 
guardian at my tower.</i>

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:06.360
This is the Guardian Tower managed by 
Skill Master Number Nine, Lord Kyotaro.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:09.730
Kyotaro? You mean the dragoid?

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:14.130
Yes. May I ask for your name, honored guest?

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:17.160
I'm Skill Master Number Three, Cayna.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.810
Your master, Kyotaro... What happened to him?

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:23.240
He is currently not here.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:26.350
Actually, he will probably 
never return to this land.

00:16:26.350 --> 00:16:26.840
Huh?

00:16:27.160 --> 00:16:29.930
The last time he was here, he said,

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:34.200
"Our dream will be over soon. 
Thank you for everything you've done.

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:35.500
It was a lot of fun."

00:16:35.500 --> 00:16:37.300
"Our dream will be over soon"?

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:43.890
"It might be a little sad that we only 
got twelve Skill Masters in the end,

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:48.540
but we might see each other again 
somewhere else," were his final words,

00:16:48.540 --> 00:16:50.110
and then he left.

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:55.300
Twelve? There should be thirteen 
Skill Masters. So why...

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:59.240
<i>I was gone, so they ended up with twelve.</i>

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:05.460
<i>Everyone's dream was over? 
Meaning Leadale came to an end?</i>

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:10.030
<i>Th-This world isn't Leadale in the future.</i>

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:17.240
<i>Leadale's online service ended, so this 
is the future after all the players left.</i>

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:21.920
Yeah... this isn't good.

00:17:21.920 --> 00:17:26.600
It's been 200 years since, 
and I had been in sleep mode,

00:17:26.930 --> 00:17:31.490
but I did detect a signal from 
a Guardian Ring a few days ago,

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:35.570
so I wanted to at least relay this message.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:39.540
But I was out of MP,

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.920
so the best I could do was cause 
a commotion by making them

00:17:41.920 --> 00:17:43.750
think there was a ghost here.

00:17:47.510 --> 00:17:48.600
Lady Cayna,

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:52.900
I officially recognize you 
as the master of this tower.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.460
Please take this.

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:02.560
I await your orders, my master.

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:10.360
All right, but I don't really 
have any orders to give you.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:15.610
Just try not to bother anyone if 
they use the colosseum up above.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:17.780
All right, as you wish.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:23.000
Okay, I'm going to head back up. 
I'll stop by again sometime.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:24.990
Yes, I will be waiting for you.

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:35.380
Come on... Get off me, Lonti.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.930
You know, you're <i>really</i> warm.

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:43.580
You're so forward, Lonti.

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.610
That's cold!

00:18:47.610 --> 00:18:49.340
Wait, it's morning?

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:52.570
Hey, where'd she go?

00:18:52.570 --> 00:18:53.600
There he is!

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:54.280
He's safe!

00:18:54.280 --> 00:18:55.650
Gah! They found me!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.740
What in the world is that beast?!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.950
I feel totally drained.

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:19.910
Even if I revive all the towers, 
all the players are gone now, right?

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.610
Oh, you haven't heard?

00:19:29.020 --> 00:19:31.640
What are you talking about, Sir Agaido?

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.950
Well, Lady Cayna...

00:19:33.950 --> 00:19:35.320
Mother Dearest?!

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:39.440
She's apparently been holed up in 
her room at the inn for two days.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:41.360
I wonder if she's sic—

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:44.620
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!

00:19:49.190 --> 00:19:51.750
I guess Lord Skargo loves 
his mother very much.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:53.170
It's Lord Skargo.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.960
Ah, he's always so lively.

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:58.510
Wow, the rain is actually avoiding him.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:20:00.470
Mother Dearest!

00:20:03.220 --> 00:20:05.460
She's still not up from her catnap.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.130
I'm getting worried.

00:20:07.790 --> 00:20:11.390
She looked like she was in a hairy situation.

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:15.020
Mother Dearest!

00:20:15.020 --> 00:20:19.820
L-Lord Skargo? And did he say "Mother Dearest"?

00:20:22.310 --> 00:20:23.610
Bam!

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:30.890
Oh!

00:20:31.590 --> 00:20:32.910
Mother Dearest!

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:35.420
It has been far too long.

00:20:38.310 --> 00:20:39.840
Forgive my tardiness,

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:42.330
but I, your eldest son, Skargo,

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.810
have come to repay all of your 
motherly love and kindness,

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.560
as I have heard you are not feeling well.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:54.140
I am here for you now.

00:20:55.690 --> 00:20:58.370
Please, come to my humble abode.

00:20:58.370 --> 00:21:01.990
Let us get you proper care for 
your exhausted body and soul.

00:21:01.990 --> 00:21:03.150
You...

00:21:03.590 --> 00:21:04.320
You?

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:09.030
Y-Y-You absolute weirdo!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.420
Boeh!

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:27.900
Isolation Barrier.

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:32.750
Listen here, Brother!

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.590
What do you think you're doing, 
running through the city?

00:21:35.590 --> 00:21:38.120
You're the high priest! Think of your position...

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.020
And I was too late.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:45.950
An Isolation Barrier?! Er, M-Mother?

00:21:46.620 --> 00:21:48.620
Oh, honestly...

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:03.750
Mother, I'll stop by again.
